---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="About Kehilat Ohr HaTorah" pageTitle="About Kehilat Ohr HaTorah" pageIcon="fas fa-info-circle" description="Learn about Kehilat Ohr HaTorah's Messianic Jewish identity, worship, and community in Orange County.">
    <p class="intro-text"><strong>Shalom, and welcome to Kehilat Ohr HaTorah.</strong></p>

    <div class="section identity-section">
        <h3><i class="fas fa-star-of-david"></i> Our Identity</h3>
        <p><strong>Kehilat Ohr HaTorah</strong> is a growing Messianic Jewish synagogue in Orange County. We honor Jewish life and practice and follow Yeshua (Jesus), the Messiah of Israel.</p>
        <p>Our full name, <strong>Kehilat Ohr HaTorah</strong>, can be translated as “Congregation of the Light of the Torah.” It speaks to our desire to read the Tanakh and Brit Chadashah as one story of God's faithfulness and redemption.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section community-section">
        <h3><i class="fas fa-users"></i> Our Community</h3>
        <p>Jewish and non-Jewish people, interfaith couples, and families are welcome. You may be:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Exploring your Jewish heritage</li>
            <li>Seeking to understand Yeshua within an authentic Jewish context</li>
            <li>Looking for a congregation rooted in Torah, prayer, and community</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Wherever you are beginning, you are welcome to come, listen, ask questions, and grow with us.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section worship-section">
        <h3><i class="fas fa-pray"></i> Our Worship</h3>
        <p>We blend traditional and contemporary Jewish practices, emphasizing:</p>
        <div class="worship-grid">
            <div class="worship-item">
                <i class="fas fa-language"></i>
                <strong>Community Prayer</strong>
                <span>Hebrew and English liturgy</span>
            </div>
            <div class="worship-item">
                <i class="fas fa-book-open"></i>
                <strong>Scripture Teaching</strong>
                <span>Tanach (Hebrew Scriptures) and New Testament study</span>
            </div>
            <div class="worship-item">
                <i class="fas fa-music"></i>
                <strong>Vibrant Music</strong>
                <span>Contemporary and traditional Messianic Jewish music and dance</span>
            </div>
            <div class="worship-item">
                <i class="fas fa-menorah"></i>
                <strong>Biblical Festivals</strong>
                <span>Celebrating God's appointed times</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="highlight-section">
        <h3><i class="fas fa-heart"></i> Our Heart</h3>
        <p>We believe Torah and the teachings of Yeshua belong together. As lifelong students of Scripture and Jewish tradition, we seek to grow in faith with love, respect, and mutual understanding.</p>
    </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
    .intro-text {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .section {
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .section h3 {
        color: var(--primary-blue);
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
    }

    .identity-section {
        background: rgba(0, 102, 204, 0.05);
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-blue);
    }

    .identity-section p {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .identity-section p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .community-section h3 {
        color: var(--gold-dark);
    }

    .community-section p {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .community-section ul {
        margin: 0 0 15px 20px;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .community-section li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .worship-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
        gap: 15px;
        margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .worship-item {
        background: var(--gray-100);
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .worship-item i {
        font-size: 2rem;
        color: var(--primary-blue);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        display: block;
    }

    .worship-item strong {
        display: block;
        color: var(--primary-blue);
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .worship-item span {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .highlight-section {
        background: var(--gold-light);
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--gold-dark);
    }

    .highlight-section h3 {
        color: var(--gold-dark);
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
    }

    .highlight-section p {
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
</style>
